# Proto CLI Plugins

Official plugins for the [proto CLI](https://github.com/proto-cli/proto).

## Structure

```
plugins/
├── shared/                    # Shared utility crate for plugins
├── template/                  # Plugin template
├── mc/                        # @proto/mc
├── mc-server/                 # @proto/mc-server
├── ai/                        # @proto/ai
├── discord/                   # @proto/discord
├── ...                        # More plugins
└── .github/workflows/         # CI for building releases
```

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install a plugin
proto plugins add mc-server

# List installed plugins
proto plugins list
```

## For Plugin Authors

See [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) for how to create your own plugin.
